    "https://fa-evyu-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/1357": {
      "title": "Executive Aide",
      "description": "Category: Administrative JobSchedule: Full time PrimaryLocation: TN, United States Job Summary The Department of Early Childhood and Elementary Education in Clemmer College of Education and Human Development is seeking a dedicated Executive Aide to support the Department. The EA will play a vital part in the day-to-day operations of the office, helping to ensure a welcoming and efficient environment for students, staff, and faculty. Key responsibilities include maintaining organized databases of faculty, staff, adjuncts, and students, entering courses for each upcoming semester, completing contracts, receiving and directing phone or email communication to the appropriate party, and overseeing student office workers. The EA will also communicate regularly with the Chair, assist students, faculty, and staff with Department-related questions, and coordinate logistical arrangements for meetings. Additional duties involve maintaining meeting minutes, updating office materials, purchasing supplies, and assisting with budget oversight. Other duties may be assigned as needed. Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities Knowledge of computer skills including Word/Quatro Pro and Microsoft Office. Knowledge of database preparation and management. Ability to communicate effectively. Required Qualifications High school diploma or GED required; Three (3) years secretarial or clerical experience; Or an equivalent combination of education and experience. Compensation & Benefits Job Family – Administrative Associate 3 Market Range: 4 (Salary Schedules) For information on benefits please visit www.etsu.edu/human-resources/benefits/ . Application Instructions Non-exempt positions are only required to be posted for a minimum of five (5) calendar days. The closing date for this posting is subject to change without notice to applicants. Employment contingent on a satisfactory background check. ETSU is an equal opportunity employer. University Overview East Tennessee State Univ