    "https://fa-evyu-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/1213": {
      "title": "Cast Member, Mascot Program (Temporary)",
      "description": "Category: Temporary JobSchedule: Part time PrimaryLocation: TN, United States The ETSU Bucky Mascot plays a vital role in promoting school spirit, engaging with fans, and representing the university at various events. This physically demanding position requires wearing a heavy costume for extended periods while performing energetic routines, dancing, and interacting with the public. Requirements: Must be a current ETSU student in good academic standing with no disciplinary history Strong communication and interpersonal skills High level of enthusiasm and school spirit Physical ability to dance, jump, and perform in a hot, heavy costume Reliable, punctual, and professional demeanor Flexible availability, including evenings, weekends, and holidays Prior mascot or performance experience is a plus, but not required Additional Expectations: Cast members must participate in at least 15 Bucky events per semester Must maintain high energy and enthusiasm throughout each appearance "
