      "title": "Temporary PA - Office of Intercollegiate Athletics",
      "description": "Category: Temporary JobSchedule: Part time PrimaryLocation: TN, United States Job Summary Serve as the official Public Address (PA) Announcer and Scoreboard Operator for collegiate softball and baseball home games. Responsible for delivering clear, professional game-day announcements while accurately operating the scoreboard and maintaining official game information in real time. "
